      notes: '### Start\nExtract all 14 files. Serve the prebuilt `built/index.html` immediately over any static HTTP server or run `npm install && npm run dev` to edit the React + TypeScript source. `CUSTOMISE.md` covers replacing the 5 CloudFront video URLs, tuning the hero mouse-scrub sensitivity and updating the Metrics and Architecture sections.\n\n### Fonts, icons and 5 video streams\nAll typography (`--font-sans`, `--font-serif`, `--font-mono`) uses Google Font `Space Mono` (`400, 700, italic`), paired with `Anton SC` for the radial-gradient `"TRANSCENDENCE"` hero watermark (`background-clip: text`) and Bootstrap Icons CDN (`bi bi-apple`) on the `Download` pill.\n\n### Interaction & motion\nThe hero video starts paused and scrubs forward/backward via horizontal mouse delta (`sensitivity = 0.8`) chained through the `seeked` event; after an `800ms` entrance delay, `Brain / And Body` and `One / Network` decode left-to-right via `ScrambleIn` (`25ms` interval); the navbar menu capsule expands with a spring (`48px → 290px`, `stiffness: 350, damping: 28`) housing `SquashHamburger` and `ScrambleText` hover links (`About`, `Metrics`, `Download`); Section 2 tilts in 3D perspective (`rotateX(24deg)`) driven by Framer Motion `useScroll` + `useSpring`.\n\n### Scope\nSingle-page product showcase with no bundled desktop installer or live neural telemetry backend. Read `LICENCE.txt` and `THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt` before publishing.',
