      "notes": "### Start\nExtract designpro.zip and read CUSTOMISE.md and README.md. Install Node.js 20.19+ or 22.12+, run npm install and npm run dev to edit, or npm run build to publish dist/. A prebuilt static bundle is included in built/ for immediate HTTP hosting. Direct file:// opening is unsupported.\n\n### Code and assets\nsrc/components/ShinyText.tsx implements the continuous left-to-right gradient sweep using framer-motion (useMotionValue, useAnimationFrame, useTransform) with baseColor #64CEFB, shineColor #ffffff, a 100° spread and a 3s cycle. src/App.tsx defines the looping video URL (VIDEO_URL), the 7 navigation links (NAV_ITEMS), the two-column sub-header, the centered Become / Product Leader. headline and the interactive enrollment modal (#enrollment-modal).\n\n### Interaction & motion\nThe white highlight sweeps continuously from left to right across Product Leader.; hovering Apply for Next Enrollment translates the ArrowRight icon to the right (group-hover:translate-x-1); clicking Apply for Next Enrollment or Contact us opens the enrollment application modal (with Escape key dismissal); below lg, the hamburger button toggles the mobile navigation drawer.\n\n### Scope\nNavigation anchors and the enrollment form are client-side demonstration flows to connect to your live admissions routes before launch. Review LICENCE.txt and THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt before publishing."
